</table:table-row></table:table-header-rows>
<table:table-row>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Createur</text:p></table:table-cell>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">10 EUR</text:p></table:table-cell>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Porteur, Infoporteur, Podcaster</text:p></table:table-cell>
</table:table-row>
<table:table-row>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Investisseur</text:p></table:table-cell>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">20 EUR</text:p></table:table-cell>
<table:table-cell table:style-name="TableCell" office:value-type="string"><text:p text:style-name="Table_20_Contents">Investisseur, Investi-lecteur, Auditeur</text:p></table:table-cell>
</table:table-row>
</table:table>
<text:list text:style-name="List_20_1">
<text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Bullet">Depot unique lors de l'activation du profil</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Bullet">Remboursable integralement en cas de resiliation du compte</text:p></text:list-item>
<text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="List_20_Bullet">Non deductible des gains</text:p></text:list-item>
</text:list>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>

<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<!-- 5. FILMS / VIDEOS / DOCUMENTAIRES -->
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">5. Films / Videos / Documentaires - Cloture 40/30/7/23</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">Frequence de cloture : Configurable par l'admin (cycle variable).</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">Profils concernes : Porteur (createur) + Investisseur (investisseur).</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>

<text:p text:style-name="Standard"><text:span text:style-name="Bold">Soit P le pot net (apres frais Stripe) a la cloture.</text:span></text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>

<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">A) 40% -&gt; Investisseurs TOP 10</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">P_Inv_Top10 = 0,40 x P</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">part_i = P_Inv_Top10 x (V_i / Sum(V_j)) pour j dans TOP 10</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">Repartition ponderee par le nombre de votes (montant investi).</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>

<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_3" text:outline-level="3">Detail BPS par rang TOP 10 Investisseurs</text:h>
