<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2">B) 30% -&gt; Porteurs TOP 10</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">P_Porteurs_Top10 = 0,30 x P</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">part_c = P_Porteurs_Top10 x (score_c / Sum(score_Top10))</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard">score_c = score final du projet c (votes x engagement x qualite)</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Standard"/>

